></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4b566ec1-1d8d-48a2-bb66-f3f48b8d9cf7</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4b566ec1-1d8d-48a2-bb66-f3f48b8d9cf7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4b566ec1-1d8d-48a2-bb66-f3f48b8d9cf7\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the first floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Felogyr%27s_Fireworks\" title=\"Felogyr's Fireworks\">Felogyr's Fireworks</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-127</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This book contains several recipes for bespoke firework concoctions and appears to have been written with the intent of being mass-produced]\n</p><p><br>\nINTRODUCTION\n</p><p><br>\nIf you find my little book in your hands, it is most likely because you, like myself, live for the thrill of combustion. It can be fraught road, discovering an outlet for such a passion that leads not to destruction, but to delight.\n</p><p><br>\nAh, delight. This is the point entire of the art of fireworking. To enchant, to move, to titillate. Within these pages you'll find the distillation of my many years of fire-craft with the hope of elevating this craft I love so well.\n</p><p><br>\nI wish you the best of luck, and do stop by my shop in Baldur's Gate for supplies, advice, and camaraderie. I am always keen to meet like minds for explosive conservation!\n</p><p><br>\nSincerely,\n</p><p><br>\nAvery Sonshal\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202522\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32915/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9873/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930854/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.468      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.468      1 -total\n 55.38%   22.966      7 Template:Icon_text\n 49.27%   20.432     17 Template:Trim\n 22.49%    9.324      2 Template:Uid\n 15.70%    6.512      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.93%    5.363      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.90%    5.351      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.20%    4.230      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.11%    4.194      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35144-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202522 and revision id 325712. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}